<title>POLAND: MOSTOSTAL W WINS DM 2 MILLION CONTRACT.</title>
<headline>MOSTOSTAL W WINS DM 2 MILLION CONTRACT.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish construction company Mostostal Warszawa SA signed a two-million-mark contract to build the steel frame for a several-storey parking garage at Cologne airport, the company said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>Work on the project should begin in December and last until August of next year, the statement said.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
